# E2E kit

UI screens: `{screen}.selectors.ts` (data) → locators → page (`BasePage`) → steps. Flows compose steps. Specs live under `specs/{smoke,happy-path,failure-cases,a11y,visual}/` and import fixtures, steps, and flows **only**.

Prefer role/label. `testId` if the accessible name is unstable. CSS last. No Cypress.

```ts
// BAD — spec imports selectors
import { homeSelectors } from '../../screens/home/home.selectors.ts';

// GOOD
import { reachHome } from '../../flows/reach-home.flow.ts';
import { test } from '../../fixtures/e2e-test.ts';
test('home page is reachable', async ({ homePage }) => {
  await reachHome({ homePage });
});
```

API e2e is HTTP-only (`request`). No page objects.
